00:00:01,115 --> 00:00:04,992
The "Ultimate PowerPoint Companion App" allows one to do more with PowerPoint.

2
00:00:05,166 --> 00:00:11,204
In particular, it handles creating voice overs with AI to where I cloned my voice for this presentation.

3
00:00:11,714 --> 00:00:16,149
It has enhanced editing for displaying and following the rules of scripture.

4
00:00:16,962 --> 00:00:28,665
It can also handle cross-reference information that comes from the YouVersion integration. It is good to note that this app will be free and open source for personal and non-profit organizations.

